WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
When someone hits you, just stand there stupidly

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:04,190
Now give him two slaps

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:05,550
Slap him back

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:08,900
Give him a slap in the face

5
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,820
Captain Rong Good morning

6
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,020
Did you just see me being bullied?

7
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,160
Sorry, Captain Han, I was wrong

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:38,860
Don't apologize to me and take it out on him, okay?

9
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:45,580
Be polite to my people next time, Captain Han, I have some amnesia.
